&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;📝 &lt;strong&gt;Adaptive Quizzes&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;Multi-format assessments (Multiple Choice, True/False, Multi-Answer) generated per subject and topic&lt;/td&gt;
